    "title": "Mirror - Make up",
    "description": "Mirror - make up, check your look anywhere!\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fMirror-make up lets you effortlessly enhance your appearance. With its sharp camera and intuitive gestures, check your makeup from every angle. Freeze frames to instantly save photos, or use fun modes like 3D rotate to show off your killer looks. Compare before-after transformations side-by-side. Save progress pictures over time to watch your style evolve. Share clips or pics to social media with one simple tap. Mirror-make up makes putting your best face forward completely hassle-free. Toss the compact for good - this smart mirror has all you need.\r\n\r\nWhy is Mirror-make up better than your phone camera?\r\n\u2714Enjoy Instagram-worthy shots with 3D rotate\r\n\u2714More effortless gestures than phone camera\r\n\u2714One-tap lighting adjustments\r\n\u2714In-app zoom capability\r\n\u2714Freeze frames to save photos instantly\r\n\u2714Browse all saved shots in-app\r\n\u2714No fuss sharing to social platforms\r\n\r\nWe care about our users and are focused on delivering the best user experience. Mirror will show you how a thoughtful application can make an impact.\r\n\r\nWe strive to satisfy users. If you have any suggestions or if you have any issues with Mirror, please do not hesitate to contact us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mirror - make up, check your look anywhere!\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fMirror-make up lets you effortlessly enhance your appearance. With its sharp camera and intuitive gestures, check your makeup from every angle. Freeze frames to instantly save photos, or use fun modes like 3D rotate to show off your killer looks. Compare before-after transformations side-by-side. Save progress pictures over time to watch your style evolve. Share clips or pics to social media with one simple tap. Mirror-make up makes putting your best face forward completely hassle-free. Toss the compact for good - this smart mirror has all you need.<br><br>Why is Mirror-make up better than your phone camera?<br>\u2714Enjoy Instagram-worthy shots with 3D rotate<br>\u2714More effortless gestures than phone camera<br>\u2714One-tap lighting adjustments<br>\u2714In-app zoom capability<br>\u2714Freeze frames to save photos instantly<br>\u2714Browse all saved shots in-app<br>\u2714No fuss sharing to social platforms<br><br>We care about our users and are focused on delivering the best user experience. Mirror will show you how a thoughtful application can make an impact.<br><br>We strive to satisfy users. If you have any suggestions or if you have any issues with Mirror, please do not hesitate to contact us.",
